South Carolina QSO Party in-state received locations, rules rev. 2.2.26 section 9.2.1
46 counties plus 50 states (South Carolina included) plus DC plus 13 provinces: 110.
The class adds SC state credit on a county QSO (issue 317).
The Sc line has a display name and NO alias: SC stations send their county, never SC.
DC is its own multiplier (rules 5.2). DX is points only, with no multiplier entry.

